# NOT USED ON THIS MACHINE -- kept only so the situation is documented.
#
# This file is read by /etc/X11/Xsession.d/40x11-common_xsessionrc, which runs
# only if the session goes through Xsession(5). It does not here: the chain is
# runsvdir -> slimski -> desktop-session -> i3, and /usr/local/bin/desktop-session
# never sources Xsession. Verified by checking i3's own environment -- none of
# the variables this file used to export were present in it.
#
# The exports that used to live here (XCURSOR_THEME, XCURSOR_SIZE, and the
# HiDPI GDK_*/QT_* settings) are now in:
#
#     ~/.desktop-session/desktop-session.conf
#
# which desktop-session sources as bash before starting the window manager, so
# they actually reach i3 and its children. Put new session-wide environment
# variables there, not here.
